10303
07:47:38.050 --> 07:47:38.890
without doing anything.

10304
07:47:38.890 --> 07:47:40.330
You're telling me you can prompt the models

10305
07:47:40.330 --> 07:47:42.690
to like make a billion dollars, make a mistake.

10306
07:47:42.690 --> 07:47:43.530
No mistakes.

10307
07:47:43.530 --> 07:47:46.170
I have an age of running when we started the stream

10308
07:47:46.210 --> 07:47:47.290
