10354
07:49:32.290 --> 07:49:36.050
a clear understanding of what it is that you want to build

10355
07:49:36.050 --> 07:49:38.890
and a lot of good taste and good judgment

10356
07:49:38.890 --> 07:49:41.490
of what should go into the product.

10357
07:49:41.490 --> 07:49:42.850
And then the other person you need

10358
07:49:42.850 --> 07:49:47.210
is someone who is relentless at making things happen

10359
07:49:47.210 --> 07:49:50.890
and even better when you can find someone who can do both.

10360
07:49:50.890 --> 07:49:55.010
